---
layout: layouts/page.njk
basePath: /faq/
title: FAQ
heading: Questions, answered honestly
standfirst: Including the ones where the answer is "not decided yet".
description: Frequently asked questions about the Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027 in Nairobi — dates, registration, fees, venue, speakers, exhibition and travel.
---

{# One array feeds both the visible list and the FAQPage JSON-LD, so the two
   cannot disagree. Answers may carry inline links: schema.org permits anchors
   in acceptedAnswer.text, and an FAQ that says "the Venue page" without linking
   to it is the one page where that failure is most annoying. Rendered with
   `| safe` below; `| dump` escapes them correctly for the JSON-LD. #}
{% set faqs = [
  { cat: "Dates and place", q: "When is the summit?", a: "The Kenya-China Tea Summit takes place from 21 to 23 April 2027." },
  { cat: "Dates and place", q: "Where will it be held?", a: "The summit will be held in Nairobi, Kenya. The venue will be announced once arrangements are finalised. See the <a href=\"/venue/\">Venue page</a>." },
  { cat: "Registering", q: "Is registration open?", a: "Expressions of interest are open. Formal ticket sales and confirmed participation packages are not yet available." },
  { cat: "Registering", q: "Does registering interest reserve a place?", a: "No. It records your interest and allows the summit team to send you relevant updates. Formal registration will be required when booking opens." },
  { cat: "Registering", q: "How much will it cost?", a: "Delegate fees, exhibitor rates and partnership packages will be announced after approval. Official participation rates are issued by the Secretariat and published here once confirmed." },
  { cat: "The programme", q: "Who should attend?", a: "The summit is intended for tea producers, processors, exporters, buyers, investors, technology companies, logistics providers, public institutions, researchers, hospitality professionals and media." },
  { cat: "The programme", q: "What happens on each day?", a: "Day one focuses on trade. Day two covers investment, innovation and B2B meetings. Day three includes the International Tea & Technology Expo, cultural exchange and the closing programme." },
  { cat: "The programme", q: "Who is speaking?", a: "Confirmed speakers will be published after they accept their invitations and session details are approved." },
  { cat: "The programme", q: "Can I propose a session?", a: "Yes. The <a href=\"/speakers/\">Speakers page</a> explains how to contact the summit team with a proposal. Submission does not guarantee inclusion in the programme." },
  { cat: "The programme", q: "What language will the summit use?", a: "The working languages and interpretation arrangements are still being confirmed. They will be published with the detailed programme." },
  { cat: "Exhibiting, partnership and B2B", q: "How do I exhibit?", a: "Register exhibitor interest through the <a href=\"/exhibition/\">Exhibition page</a>. The summit team will send stand options, rates and application information when available." },
  { cat: "Exhibiting, partnership and B2B", q: "How do I become a partner?", a: "Use the <a href=\"/sponsorship/\">Partnership page</a> to describe your preferred level, audience and objectives. The partnership team will respond with approved options when packages are ready." },
  { cat: "Exhibiting, partnership and B2B", q: "How will B2B matchmaking work?", a: "Participants will create business profiles, state what they are looking for and receive relevant meeting recommendations. Eligibility, access and pricing are still to be confirmed." },
  { cat: "Practicalities", q: "Do I need a visa?", a: "Requirements depend on nationality and individual circumstances. Check <a href=\"https://www.etakenya.go.ke/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya's official Electronic Travel Authorisation website</a> and your government's travel advice." },
  { cat: "Practicalities", q: "Will invitation letters be available?", a: "The summit team's invitation-letter policy is being confirmed. An invitation letter, where provided, does not guarantee immigration approval." },
  { cat: "Practicalities", q: "Is there an official summit hotel?", a: "The accommodation plan will be announced after the venue and hotel arrangements are confirmed." },
  { cat: "Practicalities", q: "Will the summit be streamed or recorded?", a: "Recording and streaming arrangements have not been confirmed." },
  { cat: "Updates and contact", q: "How can I receive updates?", a: "<a href=\"/registration/\">Register your interest</a> or follow the <a href=\"/news/\">summit news page</a>." },
  { cat: "Updates and contact", q: "My question is not listed", a: "<a href=\"/contact/\">Contact the summit team</a> and include enough detail for your enquiry to be routed correctly." }
] %}

{% block head %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {% for item in faqs %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ item.q | dump | safe }},
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ item.a | dump | safe }} }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

{% for item in faqs %}
{% if loop.first or item.cat != faqs[loop.index0 - 1].cat %}
<h2>{{ item.cat }}</h2>
{% endif %}
<h3>{{ item.q }}</h3>
<p>{{ item.a | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}

{% from "components/image-grid.njk" import grid %}
<aside class="rail">
  {{ grid([
    {src:"/img/plates/tea-canopy-plucking-table", alt:"The even canopy of a tea plucking table, with planted slopes rising behind it."}
  ], "", "", "(min-width: 64rem) 300px, 100vw") }}
  <div class="rail__card">
    <p class="label">Still have a question</p>
    <p>Anything this page does not answer, ask the summit team directly.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact/">Contact the summit team</a></p>
  </div>
</aside>
